nc. (MOD). This chart runs from Apr 24, 2024 to Aug 30, 2024.","setup":"The stock rose about 49% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 8 weeks, peaking at $118.95 and pulling back 22% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Jul 15, 2024 it closed at $123.02, its first close above the base high of $118.95. Volume that day was 763K shares, 0.94x the prior 10-day average of 811K. It didn't hold. By Jul 19, 2024 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $132.00.","lesson":"This is an example of a shakeout. The breakout failed by the rules, closing below the level three days running, and then the stock recovered and ran. Cutting it was still the right call when it happened. A failed breakout that fixes itself is worth watching for a re-entry, not a reason to ignore the exit."}}